{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他此刻喜欢得格外畅快，甚至为自己能这样在乎一个人而感到幸福。因为亲近已经给过他真实的满足，这份心意本身也成了快乐。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始从爱着一个人本身获得快乐。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"这种解释把欢喜落在他对自身感情的珍惜上，承接了此前真实的满足与在乎的加深，但为自己的爱而高兴仍是一步合理推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选1\",\n        \"候选2\",\n        \"候选3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他的欢喜变得明亮而有冲劲，心里生出继续靠近的兴致。因为先前的满足唤起了更深的渴望，向前靠近本身也开始让他快乐。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始从继续靠近、追求更深亲近的过程本身感到快乐。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 9,\n      \"why\": \"这种解释把欢喜落在继续靠近的兴致上，直接承接了已经确立的更深亲近之愿，也符合这一段热烈而轻快的听感。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选14\",\n        \"候选11\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "06bddd05-cb57-4f74-b255-67b51f30a289", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T021658048753Z", "elapsed_seconds": 288.14, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:21:46.201736+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0b21e4acfa4c02a639069504f7a5a18dc9ba5f9df5cfcc8a0443f93111a54bd6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_we